    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grok 4.7 on wolfram2002-ch05-22: not-empirically-resolvable, resolvability 0.14";
    dc:description "Whether equations-as-constraints delayed the recognition of complexity is a counterfactual about the history of science. Publication archives record what was studied; they do not record which alternative methods would have found the phenomenon. No outcome distinguishes this reason from other accounts of the same history.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    dc:type "resolution-route/none";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: The sentence names a historical cause of a disciplinary failure. No variable in the scientific record is the counterfactual complexity research that would have occurred under a different choice of equations.";
